    {
      "id": "seed|2957519|25",
      "text": "有人說聽見了低樓層的結構在微微嗡鳴，像建築在呼吸",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1774511555,
      "expires_at": 1774515155
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2957524|22",
      "text": "三樓醫療區最近比較忙，好像是採集隊回城的季節",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1774514938,
      "expires_at": 1774518538
